flowchart TD
  run["Run a scenario<br/>Purpose + what to watch + cell"]
  notice["Notice the recorded result<br/>Normal / uncertain / failed"]
  inspect["Investigate this pick<br/>Symptom / finding / limits / hypothesis"]
  evidence["Evidence + manual inspection<br/>Journal / assessed report / events / files"]
  return["Return to simulation<br/>Same selection and paused replay frame"]
  review["Explicitly request a sensor report<br/>Original-command reconciliation only"]
  run --> notice
  notice --> inspect
  inspect --> evidence
  evidence --> return
  return --> run
  inspect --> review
